{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The\u00a0Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumor says Room 404 can stir your deepest desires \u2014 a place where lonely hearts dream of being touched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After your death, you awaken as the ghost bound to that very room, watching new tenants move in, each carrying their own longing and fear. You can comfort them, or haunt them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938800/extras/b0ae578369b77f88466e0693c5ac9d2b.poster.avif?t=1772608067\" width=1024 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938800/extras/b0ae578369b77f88466e0693c5ac9d2b.webm?t=1772608067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different Characters, Different Desires</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938800/extras/025fa8cb0a41cb9b60b97cc53db39e10.avif?t=1772608067\" width=512 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every renter has their own secret preferences and emotional triggers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task as the ghost is to observe, learn, and act \u2014 discover what they crave to make them stay\u2026 or push them away forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Animated LEWD and SEX Scenes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938800/extras/308f8004dbf1d34e4ee8a53914984d74.poster.avif?t=1772608067\" width=512 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938800/extras/308f8004dbf1d34e4ee8a53914984d74.webm?t=1772608067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938800/extras/308f8004dbf1d34e4ee8a53914984d74.mp4?t=1772608067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautifully animated sequences that bring the most intimate dreams to life \u2014 each reflecting the renter\u2019s personality and your choices.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dream &amp; Nightmare Sequences</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your tenant\u2019s emotional state. High Heart unlocks <i>fantasy dream scenes</i>, high Fear unlocks <i>nightmare sequences</i>.\u00a0Each dream or nightmare is split into multiple stages. Unlock the next scene by reaching the right emotional threshold or replaying with different approaches.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0Interactive Apartment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u200b\u200b\u200b</strong>Use doors, mirrors, showers, beds, lights, and everyday items to haunt creatively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3938800?t=1772608067","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938800/fcfe1f30a60f34a34a78525d9305aaaee5e81c9f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772608067","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938800/78064439fd2cb4c849cf314464a27ef229cf1989/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772608067","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938800/78064439fd2cb4c849cf314464a27ef229cf1989/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772608067","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"This game contains adult themes and sexual content, including partial nudity and depictions of sexual activity. Some scenarios may include suggestive or intimate interactions between characters, presented in a fantasy/supernatural context. Player choices can lead to sexual dream sequences.\r\n\r\nThe game does not depict sexual assault/non-consensual sex, drug or alcohol abuse, or self-harm."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The\u00a0Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumor says Room 404 can stir your deepest desires \u2014 a place where lonely hearts dream of being touched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After your death, you awaken as the ghost bound to that very room, watching new tenants move in, each carrying their own longing and fear. You can comfort them, or haunt them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938800/extras/b0ae578369b77f88466e0693c5ac9d2b.poster.avif?t=1772608067\" width=1024 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938800/extras/b0ae578369b77f88466e0693c5ac9d2b.webm?t=1772608067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different Characters, Different Desires</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938800/extras/025fa8cb0a41c